        "subject": "LU-20539 - changed.py: unchanged subtests marked as changed",
        "message": "LU-20539 - changed.py: unchanged subtests marked as changed\n\nThe changed script does not update its function context when methods are\nadded. In the example below the script would report 153a as changed and\nnow it does not:\n\n--- a/lustre/tests/conf-sanity.sh\n+++ b/lustre/tests/conf-sanity.sh\n@@ -10157,6 +10157,169 @@ test_153a() {\n }\n run_test 153a \"bypass invalid NIDs quickly\"\n\n+cleanup_200() {\n+\tlocal modopts=$1\n+\tstopall -f\n+\tMODOPTS_LIBCFS=$modopts\n+\tload_modules_local libcfs\n+}\n\nChange-Id: Id93b1b3c2fc1695a48b2d258e8697d1ad287e3d4\nSigned-off-by: Charlie Olmstead <charlie@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
